B = [
('Vans','North America','1970s-present','footwear','In the style of Vans, laid-back California skate-park grit with a handmade, lived-in charm. Thick cream-white vulcanised rubber with waffle texture, tall white edge bands and rounded, low, flat silhouettes. Hard-wearing duck canvas and suede with chunky double stitching, scuffed and creased on purpose. Palette is navy, black, red, olive and off-white, with a small square black and white checkerboard as the signature repeat, plus wavy side stripes and skull-and-crossbones doodles. Lettering is a bold, slanted, hand-painted style with a long swooping underline, set in a red rectangular tab or stacked on boxy red cardboard. Photography is sun-bleached, grainy and street-level, with graffiti, concrete ramps and punk zine collage.'),
('Converse','North America','1920s-present','footwear','In the style of Converse, classic American court and garage-band heritage in its simplest form. Soft cotton canvas stretched over a rounded, minimal shape, framed by glossy off-white rubber trim with a thin coloured stripe, flat laces and shiny metal eyelets. A small circular badge carrying a star and chevron mark recurs as the emblem. Palette is optic white, black, cherry red, navy, mustard and faded pastels, with sports-team stripes and star motifs. Lettering is bold, wide, collegiate capitals, sometimes slanted and outlined, often in navy and red. Graphics feel like vintage athletic posters with halftone dots and ink-stamp texture, while photography is moody, cinematic and urban, with worn, creased, signed-by-use character and kraft wooden crate packaging.'),
('Pepsi','North America','1950s-present','beverages','In the style of Pepsi, bold, electric, pop-culture energy built on a round globe divided into red, white and blue. A white wave runs through the circle, which tilts, smiles or splits into bold slices and large flat discs. Palette is deep cobalt and midnight blue with bright red, crisp white and pops of electric blue glow, with black used for modern, edgy variants. Lettering is lowercase, wide, clean and geometric, often set in huge scale or tucked beside the globe. Surfaces are glossy, chilled and metallic, covered in condensation, ice and fizz bubbles, with dark backgrounds lit by neon rim light. Layouts are graphic, high-contrast and youthful, with retro bottle-cap serrations as a nostalgic echo.'),
('Guinness','Europe','1930s-present','beverages','In the style of Guinness, dark Irish heritage with polished, premium restraint. Rich near-black grounds with creamy off-white and warm gold accents, with a single golden harp emblem placed centrally, drawn in fine, elegant outlines. Lettering is slim, tall, classic serif capitals with a looping handwritten flourish beneath, often gold-foiled or embossed. Layouts are symmetrical, orderly and spacious, with thin gold borders and a creamy foam-like white tone against deep black. Packaging uses matte black and bright, patterned colour panels with gold detailing, and sometimes festive illustrated motifs in blue, green, yellow and red. Photography is warm, low-lit, candlelit pub atmosphere with amber glow, wood, brick and friendly gatherings.'),
('Starbucks','North America','1990s-present','cafe','In the style of Starbucks, welcoming neighbourhood warmth in deep siren green and creamy white. A round emblem of a crowned, twin-tailed maiden sits inside a ring of capital lettering, shown as a clean green and white roundel, often cropped large or reduced to a simple line mark. Palette is forest green, cream, espresso brown and black, with seasonal bursts of warm orange, red, pink and lilac in flat geometric patterns, leaves, beans and swirls. Materials are matte paper, kraft cardboard, ceramic, brushed metal and green fabric, finished in clean minimal layouts. Lettering is rounded, friendly sans-serif with small handwritten touches. Photography is soft, sunlit and cosy, with steam, close hands and cafe warmth.'),
]
